Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: parserInternals.c
Line: 1743
Function: xmlGetActualEncoding
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: The function dereferences ctxt and ctxt->input without NULL checks (e.g., ctxt->input->flags at line 1743). Calling xmlGetActualEncoding with a NULL ctxt or with ctxt->input unset leads to a NULL pointer dereference and crash.

